WEBVTT

00:10:57.579 --> 00:11:01.162
And the way she talked to me about it is
that there will be times in your life

00:11:01.537 --> 00:11:05.787
that you need to ride into
battle for yourself

00:11:06.204 --> 00:11:08.287
and you need to teach yourself
how to do that.

00:11:08.287 --> 00:11:12.079
And, you know, I would say that that
extends beyond necessarily the father.

00:11:12.079 --> 00:11:16.996
I think that, you know, if we didn't get
that essential sense of self-worth from

00:11:16.996 --> 00:11:20.329
both parents, we need to reckon
with that in our adult lives.

00:11:20.871 --> 00:11:25.246
And so with my father, I had
to heal many things.

00:11:25.662 --> 00:11:28.787
But but the most the biggest one you
ask what the most important one

00:11:28.787 --> 00:11:30.746
I think it was that sense is that.